  "description": {
    "zh": "低筋面粉通常来自较软小麦，蛋白质含量较低，面筋形成能力较弱，适合蛋糕、饼干和酥点。与中筋、高筋面粉的区别主要是小麦硬度和蛋白质/面筋强度，不是营养学上的低碳水食品。",
    "en": "Cake flour is generally milled from softer wheat and has lower protein and weaker gluten development than all-purpose or bread flour. The baking distinction is wheat hardness and gluten strength, not low carbohydrate content."
  },
